; claude: the examples name their textures by a path relative to the
; repo root ("examples/checker.png"), which a web page resolves
; relative to itself, i.e. to this directory; a dune rule can only
; create files in its own directory, hence this one, with only the
; copy. See ../dune's default alias, which builds it.
(rule
  (copy ../../checker.png checker.png))
